    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n38047" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπαν-ᾰγωγή</span></b> , ἡ,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>sailing against, naual
				attack,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Th.
				7.34
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπανήγαγεν τὰς ἐ. καθ᾽ ἕκαστον
				μῆνα ποιούμενος</span> perh. held the monthly naval
				<i>manoeuvres,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				IG
				22.1227.12
			</span></i> (Salamis, <span class="entity">ii B.C.</span>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>leading up, exalting,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῦ βελτίστου πρὸς τὴν τοῦ ἀρίστου
					θέαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>R.</u>
					532c
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> Rhet.,
				<i>return to the point,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Corn.
				<u>Rh.</u>
				p.397
			</span></i> H. (pl.).</div>
